WEBVTT

00:05.260 --> 00:06.650
How rare.

00:07.020 --> 00:09.860
For once, the girls aren't following 
you around like little chicks.

00:09.860 --> 00:14.700
Well, they said something 
about having a meeting

00:14.700 --> 00:18.670
to decide the future of the organization
 since the top executives are together.

00:18.670 --> 00:20.220
Organization?

00:20.220 --> 00:22.670
They're probably just at that age.

00:23.190 --> 00:27.480
Please make sure to take care of 
the evil organization here, Mrs. Ellalaura.

00:27.480 --> 00:28.930
Leave it to me.

00:28.930 --> 00:32.150
Welp, I'm going to do 
a little shopping in town.

00:32.150 --> 00:33.850
Yes. Be safe.

00:33.850 --> 00:35.970
I'm off to do a little work myself.

00:44.890 --> 00:47.940
Going shopping while traveling is the best.

00:47.940 --> 00:51.080
There are mountains of local ingredients!

00:52.730 --> 00:54.320
The Bear Phone is ringing.

01:02.610 --> 01:03.950
Hello, Fina?

01:06.960 --> 01:08.070
Fina?

01:09.760 --> 01:12.040
<i>...na Sis...</i>

01:12.040 --> 01:15.360
Fina! What's wrong?! Did something happen?

01:15.360 --> 01:18.900
<i>Yuna Sis, help...</i>

01:18.900 --> 01:20.100
Fina!

01:46.250 --> 01:48.040
Fina! Noa!

01:48.380 --> 01:49.490
Fina!

01:58.590 --> 01:59.640
Noa!

02:00.820 --> 02:04.220
She's not hurt, but she's unconscious.

02:06.490 --> 02:07.220
Huh?

02:07.580 --> 02:09.000
Where's Misa?

02:09.000 --> 02:11.770
Yuna Sis...

02:11.770 --> 02:12.820
Fina?!

02:12.820 --> 02:14.720
What in the world happened?!

02:14.720 --> 02:16.080
Misa...

02:16.080 --> 02:17.790
Lady Misa...

02:19.300 --> 02:20.530
What happened to Misa?!

02:20.530 --> 02:25.430
A man dressed in black captured Lady Misa...

02:25.430 --> 02:31.000
We tried to stop him, but we couldn't...

02:31.460 --> 02:33.920
I'm sorry...

02:39.410 --> 02:41.100
It's not your fault, Fina.

02:42.400 --> 02:47.060
Everyone tried their best to protect Misa.

02:47.390 --> 02:50.120
Please, Yuna Sis...

02:50.120 --> 02:55.020
Lady Misa... Please save our friend!

02:55.890 --> 02:58.780
Don't worry. Leave everything to me.

03:01.220 --> 03:02.140
Yeah.

03:10.620 --> 03:11.680
This...

03:12.300 --> 03:13.790
N-Noa!

03:13.790 --> 03:15.590
What in the world happened here?!

03:18.570 --> 03:20.020
Cliff.

03:20.020 --> 03:21.800
Take care of the girls.

03:22.190 --> 03:24.300
I'm going to go save Misa.

03:24.760 --> 03:26.010
Yuna?

03:26.010 --> 03:27.720
Hey, what happened here?!

03:27.720 --> 03:29.930
Wh-What happened to Misa?!

03:33.510 --> 03:36.250
Can the two of you find Misa?

03:41.830 --> 03:42.740
Let's go.

03:42.740 --> 03:44.200
Yuna!

03:58.710 --> 04:03.760
The Farrengram family didn't see you, right?

04:03.760 --> 04:05.890
I disguised myself.

04:05.890 --> 04:10.280
It was easy without 
that bodyguard of theirs.

04:10.280 --> 04:13.730
Either way, I'm still 
expecting proper payment.

04:14.690 --> 04:16.560
What a greedy man!

04:16.560 --> 04:17.690
Why?

04:17.690 --> 04:19.110
Why did you...

04:20.380 --> 04:22.400
What happened to Sister Noa and Fina?!

04:22.400 --> 04:24.500
You're so stupid, Misa-na.

04:24.500 --> 04:28.490
Are you sure you should be worried about 
others when you've been taken as hostage?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.700
Hostage?

04:30.700 --> 04:33.560
Yeah. Just like those brats.

04:33.560 --> 04:38.600
As long as we threaten the fools 
that go against us with their kids,

04:38.600 --> 04:40.600
they become docile.

04:41.430 --> 04:43.000
You're terrible!

04:43.650 --> 04:46.010
They're your own citizens...

04:46.010 --> 04:48.730
You're really stupid!

04:48.730 --> 04:53.890
Since they live here, the citizens 
belong to the Salbard family.

04:53.890 --> 04:55.890
We can use them however we want.

04:55.890 --> 04:59.920
Now that old geezer, Gran, 
won't be able to go against us.

04:59.920 --> 05:04.190
Just tremble in this cell until he 
loses his right to be Sheelin's lord.

05:11.140 --> 05:14.140
Sister Noa... Fina...

05:15.600 --> 05:17.120
I hate this!

05:17.120 --> 05:19.170
I wanna go home!

05:19.170 --> 05:21.960
Mom! Dad!

05:27.710 --> 05:29.050
It'll be okay.

05:29.050 --> 05:31.390
Sis!

05:31.390 --> 05:35.100
It'll be okay. She'll definitely
 come to save us!

05:35.790 --> 05:38.820
A certain strong and kind bear!

05:42.570 --> 05:44.840
You stupid boy!

05:47.190 --> 05:49.070
You kidnapped Misa-na?!

05:49.800 --> 05:52.900
I told you to stay quiet until 
Zelef returned to the royal capital!

05:52.900 --> 05:54.420
What are you doing?!

05:54.420 --> 05:56.870
I just did the same thing you did!

05:56.870 --> 05:59.060
Geezer Gran is a softie.

05:59.060 --> 06:01.490
He'll listen to all our demands 
as long as we have a hostage.

06:01.490 --> 06:03.720
How can you be this stupid?

06:03.720 --> 06:08.090
Commoners are fine, but have you thought 
about the dangers of kidnapping another noble?!

06:08.090 --> 06:10.400
You're too much of a coward, Dad!

06:10.400 --> 06:13.970
This is our city! 
We're the most powerful here!

06:13.970 --> 06:17.640
Not just the nobles. 
Even the king can't touch us!

06:17.640 --> 06:20.690
<i>I've definitely spoiled him too much.</i>

06:20.690 --> 06:25.860
<i>Someday, he's going to make a huge 
mistake and take me down with him!</i>

06:28.340 --> 06:30.000
Wh-What's going on?!

06:34.210 --> 06:34.950
Who are you?

06:36.660 --> 06:38.680
A-A bear?

06:38.680 --> 06:39.940
Where's Misa?

06:39.940 --> 06:41.260
What are you talking about?

06:41.260 --> 06:43.400
This is Lord Salbard's mansion!

06:43.400 --> 06:44.500
It's fine if you don't know.

06:53.300 --> 06:58.680
Kumayuru. Kumakyu. 
You're sure this is the place?

07:02.230 --> 07:06.070
Got it. Let's go, then.

07:13.050 --> 07:14.720
What?! What's going on?!

07:18.410 --> 07:19.970
A bear?

07:19.970 --> 07:22.020
And a bear and...

07:22.020 --> 07:23.250
A bear?

07:24.040 --> 07:25.130
What happened?!

07:25.130 --> 07:27.090
What was that noise?!

07:28.590 --> 07:32.970
Who the hell are you? 
Why are you dressed as a bear?!

07:33.300 --> 07:34.550
Where's Misa?

07:35.450 --> 07:38.290
You're the bear woman from last time!

07:38.290 --> 07:39.730
Where's Misa?

07:39.730 --> 07:42.570
What are you talking about?

07:42.570 --> 07:48.150
I don't know who you are, but you won't 
get away with attacking a noble's home.

07:48.150 --> 07:49.740
D-Dad?!

07:51.450 --> 07:54.320
Fine. I'll search for her myself.

07:54.890 --> 07:55.990
And...

07:55.990 --> 07:59.830
You guys are the ones who aren't 
going to get away with this.

08:07.170 --> 08:09.510
Wh-What are you talking about?

08:09.510 --> 08:11.040
Hey, stop!

08:11.040 --> 08:12.960
I won't allow you to do whatever you want!

08:16.430 --> 08:18.910
Even the bears managed to dodge that?

08:18.910 --> 08:23.440
Your ridiculous costume and those bears... 
Just who in the world are you?

08:23.440 --> 08:30.120
You found us so quickly, even though 
I attacked when you were absent.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.190
Brad! Don't say unnecessary things!

08:32.190 --> 08:34.760
There's no point in hiding it.

08:34.760 --> 08:40.310
This young lady already knows 
the little girl is here.

08:40.310 --> 08:41.370
Oh?

08:41.370 --> 08:43.730
What's so funny?

08:44.100 --> 08:45.790
I'm just happy.

08:46.190 --> 08:51.210
The person who hurt Fina and Noa 
came right to my doorstep.

08:51.210 --> 08:55.930
Shit! I thought no one noticed you 
when you kidnapped her, Brad!

08:55.930 --> 08:59.300
Take responsibility! Get rid 
of this woman and her bears!

08:59.300 --> 09:01.350
Yes, of course.

09:01.350 --> 09:05.020
This was a blunder on my part!

09:13.570 --> 09:17.200
You can deflect magic and 
counter with your own...

09:17.200 --> 09:19.090
Well, well.

09:19.090 --> 09:22.230
As I thought, you're quite an interesting lady!

09:25.270 --> 09:30.370
Join in, everyone! 
Don't let her leave here alive!

09:31.770 --> 09:33.880
Now, here I come!

09:33.880 --> 09:36.760
I'm leaving the small fry to you two!

09:44.390 --> 09:47.560
You have an interesting item bag!

09:48.130 --> 09:50.150
Too bad. I can see everything.

09:50.150 --> 09:52.470
That just means I need to increase my speed.

09:52.470 --> 09:54.850
Can you keep up?

09:59.670 --> 10:01.490
Hey, when are you planning on speeding up?

10:02.450 --> 10:03.950
This is just the beginning!

10:11.340 --> 10:13.190
My magic!

10:16.850 --> 10:18.660
What the hell is with that woman?!

10:18.660 --> 10:21.620
Brad is a talented ex-adventurer, you know?!

10:21.620 --> 10:25.720
He's not someone a weird woman 
like her should be able to handle!

10:56.770 --> 10:58.840
This is so much fun!

10:58.840 --> 11:02.300
Other humans are 
the best opponents in battle!

11:04.260 --> 11:07.100
Really. Who in the world are you?

11:07.100 --> 11:09.380
I knew you were strong,

11:09.380 --> 11:12.400
but I can't believe you managed to 
block all my attacks so completely.

11:12.400 --> 11:15.900
Did you only fight with 
weak people until now?

11:15.900 --> 11:20.440
Yes, I love crushing the weak.

11:20.440 --> 11:25.380
Right, just like those two little girls 
that were with my target...

11:25.950 --> 11:30.960
They tried so hard to 
protect the target from me.

11:30.960 --> 11:33.340
I couldn't help but retaliate.

11:33.340 --> 11:37.260
Stomping on their reckless 
bravery was so exciting!

11:37.260 --> 11:38.380
Shut up!

11:40.340 --> 11:43.050
I'll beat you down with these.

11:45.550 --> 11:47.760
I'd like to see you try!

11:49.810 --> 11:51.040
What?!

11:51.040 --> 11:52.390
Then, let's go up a level!

11:54.180 --> 11:56.180
Impossible! She can match this speed?!

12:05.490 --> 12:07.520
You...

12:10.660 --> 12:12.170
H-Help!

12:22.130 --> 12:24.590
Wh-Wh-Who in the world are you?!

12:24.590 --> 12:26.850
Misa's friend.

12:26.850 --> 12:29.350
I don't care about 
the fighting between nobles,

12:29.350 --> 12:31.680
but laying your hands on Misa 
is a different story.

12:31.680 --> 12:35.020
I know nothing! My son did it all on his own!

12:36.410 --> 12:39.070
H-Hey, Bear Woman!

12:40.790 --> 12:42.740
If you resist, she'll...

12:44.070 --> 12:46.660
Get your filthy hands off of Misa.

12:47.700 --> 12:49.240
S-Stop!

12:54.750 --> 12:56.960
S-Sister Yuna!

12:58.760 --> 12:59.750
Misa!

13:01.450 --> 13:04.370
M-My son did it all!

13:04.370 --> 13:06.210
I'm completely innocent!

13:06.210 --> 13:08.430
Are you trying to say this 
is none of your business?

13:08.430 --> 13:10.300
Th-That's right.

13:10.300 --> 13:15.470
Don't think you can get away with 
attacking an innocent noble like this!

13:15.470 --> 13:18.660
Looks like the apple didn't 
fall far from the tree.

13:18.660 --> 13:21.320
You're making me sick, 
will you shut up a bit?

13:22.170 --> 13:24.150
Yuna, wait!

13:29.980 --> 13:32.620
I-It hurts!

13:33.560 --> 13:35.460
Thank goodness. He's still alive.

13:35.460 --> 13:40.000
I have enough common sense to 
leave them all somewhat alive.

13:40.000 --> 13:43.000
What brings you here, Ms. Ellalaura?

13:43.000 --> 13:45.150
Capture them all.

13:45.150 --> 13:47.900
Don't use force unless necessary.

13:47.900 --> 13:48.830
Ma'am!

13:50.780 --> 13:55.270
I saw you rush through the city in a panic.

13:55.270 --> 14:00.300
I wanted to chase after you immediately, 
but I didn't know what was going on.

14:00.300 --> 14:04.510
I returned to the mansion and 
got the details of what happened.

14:04.990 --> 14:06.660
This is the result.

14:07.110 --> 14:12.250
I didn't think I'd use the guards I brought 
from the royal capital like this.

14:12.870 --> 14:15.780
I'm glad to see that you're safe, Misa.

14:15.780 --> 14:17.830
Noa and Fina are safe, as well.

14:19.980 --> 14:21.790
Thank goodness!

14:22.150 --> 14:24.830
Why are you here, Ellalaura?

14:24.830 --> 14:26.970
It has been a while, Gajurdo.

14:26.970 --> 14:30.440
I am here to inspect the city 
under His Majesty's orders.

14:30.440 --> 14:33.430
He told me to confirm 
the rumors of your evil doings.

14:34.280 --> 14:37.630
They're just rumors. You have no proof!

14:37.630 --> 14:40.490
That brat should be 
the one you need to arrest!

14:40.490 --> 14:43.450
She punched me, a noble!

14:43.880 --> 14:47.150
What are you doing?! I'm a noble!

14:48.580 --> 14:52.620
I've never been more embarrassed 
to call myself a noble.

14:52.620 --> 14:56.080
<i>Oh, she's really pissed. 
I should stay quiet.</i>

14:56.080 --> 15:00.960
True, we couldn't find any definitive 
proof during the inspection.

15:00.960 --> 15:05.460
However, you've been caught 
kidnapping another noble's daughter.

15:05.460 --> 15:07.840
Take him away if you want!

15:07.840 --> 15:09.660
I'll cut my ties with him!

15:09.660 --> 15:11.890
He and I no longer have 
anything to do with each other!

15:11.890 --> 15:13.220
This guy!

15:13.570 --> 15:15.950
Parents are responsible for their children.

15:15.950 --> 15:17.930
Did you think you could get away?

15:17.930 --> 15:20.210
I don't care what you say!

15:20.210 --> 15:25.270
Aunt Ellalaura, there are 
other kidnapped children here! {Note: I'm 99% sure not blood related Aunt.}

15:25.270 --> 15:28.610
They're children from families that 
don't listen to the Salbard family.

15:29.870 --> 15:31.220
Is that true, Misa?

15:32.970 --> 15:34.710
What is the meaning of this?

15:34.710 --> 15:37.950
No idea. I'm sure my son is the culprit.

15:37.950 --> 15:40.910
<i>Nope. I can't stay quiet!</i>

15:40.910 --> 15:43.010
Oh, I see.

15:43.010 --> 15:47.880
Will you admit to the crimes of your 
son and cooperate with his capture?

15:47.880 --> 15:49.660
Of course!

15:49.660 --> 15:53.840
It saddens me as a parent, 
but he'll have to pay for his crimes.

15:53.840 --> 15:57.310
We shall proceed without caution, then.

15:57.710 --> 16:01.390
Everyone, now that we 
have his full cooperation,

16:01.390 --> 16:03.800
search every floor and 
corner of this mansion!

16:03.800 --> 16:04.520
Ma'am!

16:04.520 --> 16:07.730
Wait! What need is there 
to search the mansion?!

16:07.730 --> 16:09.950
Don't we need to collect all the evidence?

16:09.950 --> 16:13.670
We can't just end it at his capture.

16:13.670 --> 16:19.010
Oh, but there's always a chance that 
we might <i>accidentally</i> find evidence

16:19.010 --> 16:22.210
of crimes unrelated to your son.

16:22.210 --> 16:26.040
D-Don't joke around! 
I won't allow such a thing!

16:27.140 --> 16:28.630
Thank you for your cooperation.

16:28.630 --> 16:29.930
You must be joking!

16:29.930 --> 16:34.020
Someone save me! Kill this woman!

16:34.020 --> 16:35.750
S-Stop!

16:34.710 --> 16:36.420
I'm so sorry, Yuna.

16:36.420 --> 16:38.180
You saw something distasteful.

16:38.180 --> 16:39.660
It's fine.

16:39.660 --> 16:42.280
Not all the nobles are like that.

16:42.280 --> 16:45.610
And I feel a lot better now 
thanks to you, Mrs. Ellalaura!

16:45.610 --> 16:47.140
That's good to hear.

16:47.140 --> 16:49.810
Well, then. Come along.

16:49.810 --> 16:51.740
We have to save the children 
in the basement.

16:51.740 --> 16:53.070
Should I go, too?

16:54.210 --> 16:58.670
You should fulfill your duty as the prince 
that came to save the princess.

17:02.070 --> 17:06.240
Sister Yuna, thank you 
for coming to save me.

17:06.240 --> 17:10.460
My family problems have caused 
everyone so much trouble.

17:10.460 --> 17:12.380
I cannot apologize enough...

17:12.380 --> 17:15.590
There's no need to apologize. 
You're the victim here, Misa.

17:15.590 --> 17:19.950
Such little children were treated so badly.

17:20.410 --> 17:24.490
I'm a noble and the granddaughter 
of the city lord...

17:24.810 --> 17:26.080
Misa...

17:26.080 --> 17:31.060
N-No, I-I'm not crying...

17:33.790 --> 17:36.540
It's okay now, Misa.

17:37.550 --> 17:40.160
Sister Yuna...

17:42.620 --> 17:45.380
I was scared! I was so scared!

17:45.380 --> 17:47.220
Sorry for the wait.

17:47.220 --> 17:50.130
I'm sorry something so scary happened to you.

17:50.130 --> 17:53.800
Sister Yuna! Sister Yuna!

18:11.560 --> 18:12.440
Misa!

18:11.560 --> 18:12.440
Lady Misa!

18:12.440 --> 18:15.440
Sister Noa! Fina!

18:15.440 --> 18:18.260
Misa! I'm so sorry!

18:18.260 --> 18:22.660
I'm the older one, 
but I couldn't protect you!

18:22.660 --> 18:23.870
Me, too.

18:23.870 --> 18:27.710
Even though you're my friend! 
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

18:28.160 --> 18:29.230
Fina...

18:29.230 --> 18:32.350
I'm glad the two of you are safe.

18:32.350 --> 18:37.710
If something happened to 
both of you because of me...

18:40.270 --> 18:43.720
Thank goodness!

18:45.880 --> 18:46.930
Yuna...

18:47.730 --> 18:50.510
What a grand welcome.

18:50.510 --> 18:53.130
Your actions deserve it.

18:53.130 --> 18:57.020
Goodness. We keep owing you more and more.

18:57.020 --> 18:59.240
I'm not confident we can pay you back.

18:59.240 --> 19:04.830
Yuna, the Farrengram family will 
never forget what you have done for us.

19:04.830 --> 19:08.410
Yes, you've saved Misa so many times.

19:08.410 --> 19:10.790
Thank you so much, Yuna.

19:10.790 --> 19:14.990
We will be sure to return the favor with 
the Farrengram family's name on the line.

19:23.140 --> 19:26.310
You guys are really 
over exaggerating things!

19:29.860 --> 19:31.810
<i>Their happy smiles...</i>

19:31.810 --> 19:35.800
<i>That's a good enough reason to help!</i>

19:42.380 --> 19:47.300
<i>Welp, let me tell you how things ended up.</i>

19:48.700 --> 19:51.080
<i>After finding a mountain of evidence,</i>

19:51.080 --> 19:54.850
<i>the stupid noble was imprisoned 
by the king and given the death penalty.</i>

19:54.850 --> 19:57.390
<i>The stupid son was 
stripped of his noble title.</i>

19:57.390 --> 20:01.960
<i>All his property was confiscated, 
and he was exiled from Sheelin.</i>

20:02.400 --> 20:05.800
<i>The guild master of the Sheelin 
merchant guild was dismissed</i>

20:05.800 --> 20:07.990
<i>and the economy recovered.</i>

20:07.990 --> 20:14.820
<i>Mister Gran retired and Misa's father inherited 
his position as the sole lord of Sheelin.</i>

20:16.810 --> 20:22.890
<i>A lot of stuff happened in-between, 
but that's a story for next time.</i>

20:22.890 --> 20:24.000
<i>And then...</i>

20:31.000 --> 20:34.900
Sister Noa. Fina. Please be safe.

20:34.900 --> 20:39.450
Thank you very much. Yuna Sis will
 be with us, so we'll be fine.

20:39.450 --> 20:43.260
I'll be sending you regular newsletters 
from the Miss Bear Fan Club.

20:43.630 --> 20:45.470
I can't wait.

20:46.650 --> 20:49.740
Thank you again for everything.

20:49.740 --> 20:53.020
Everyone was saved 
thanks to you, Sister Yuna.

20:53.020 --> 20:56.850
Don't worry about it. 
I just did what I wanted to do.

20:58.030 --> 20:59.940
Huh? What is it?

20:59.940 --> 21:02.220
Mother actually told me something.

21:02.220 --> 21:06.070
Yuna Sis might be a goddess 
that brings happiness to people.

21:06.070 --> 21:08.490
Huh? G-Goddess?!

21:08.490 --> 21:13.160
All good people who come in contact 
with Sister Yuna become fortunate,

21:13.160 --> 21:16.340
while all bad people become unfortunate!

21:16.340 --> 21:22.710
You were the only one who could 
bring Mister Zelef and save Lady Misa!

21:22.710 --> 21:26.220
You're the devil of misfortune 
for the Salbard family,

21:26.220 --> 21:29.550
but you're the goddess of happiness for us!

21:29.550 --> 21:34.020
Uh, goddess... That's really kinda embarrassing!

21:34.020 --> 21:36.480
You must be the goddess of bears, then!

21:38.720 --> 21:40.330
That's, uh...

21:40.710 --> 21:42.400
Well, whatever.

21:44.860 --> 21:50.070
Stay well, everyone! I can't 
wait to see you all again!

23:28.050 --> 23:29.380
We're home!

23:31.130 --> 23:39.930
<b>Tale of a Bear</b>
